  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n13/6 × {45/26 + 15/13 × (5/7 ÷ 25/14)}\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/13bc0065c96e715682af7c8a6dc1b4c567b7a2a89597cc68809a5ff942c7e421.png] \n\n**Calculations:**\n\n13/6 × {1(19)/(26) + 15/13 × (5/7 ÷ 25/14)}\n\n13/6 × {1(19)/(26) + 15/13 × (5/7 × 14/25)}\n\n⇒ 13/6 × {45/26 + 15/13 × 2/5}\n\n⇒ 13/6 × {45/26 + 30/65}\n\n⇒ 13/6 × {(225 + 60)/(13 × 5 × 2)} ----(Taking LCM of 26 and 65 = 13 × 5 × 2)\n\n⇒ 13/6 × 285/130\n\n⇒ 19/4\n\n**∴ The simplified value of the given equation is 19 / 4 or 4(3)/(4).**",
